<title>HONG KONG: Korea First seen planning debt issue.</title>
<headline>Korea First seen planning debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea First Bank is asking banks to bid on a new US$100 million debt financing, bankers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said Korea First Bank had not yet decided the type of debt instrument but the issue was likely to have a maturity of three to five years.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
